// ==UserScript==
// @name         GTA 6 Spoiler Shield
// @namespace    https://github.com/KarlssonChristoffer/gta6-spoiler-shield
// @version      1.0.0
// @description  Hides posts, videos, comments and whole pages that mention GTA 6, on every site.
// @author       Claude Fable 5.2 (AI-generated code), directed by a human
